Work in the hiyroscript/alva repository and fix #0001’s Charged BA2 / Sphere Rush (chargedActions.action2 -> chargedTechniques.rasenRush).

Do not redesign the move from scratch. Preserve the existing charged-action architecture, combat system, physics, damage values, controls, Energy behavior, facing behavior, grounding requirements, cancellation rules, and normal BA2. The problem is primarily that the current charged BA2 state/animation sequence does not represent the supplied artwork correctly.

Before changing code, inspect every relevant source sprite carefully:

* assets/characters/0001/0001_rasen1.png through 0001_rasen12.png
* assets/characters/0001/0001_prasen1.png through 0001_prasen11.png
